      "role": "user",
      "content": "i used to feel like there was someone watching over me, you know? like everything had a reason. but lately it just feels like there's nothing. just this massive, cold, empty space. i look up at the stars and i don't feel small or wonderous... i just feel like i don't matter at all. it's terrifying.",
